            <ArticleTitle>Spontaneous missed abortion caused by Ascaris lumbricoides.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>188-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this report, a case of spontaneous missed abortion caused by Ascaris lumbricoides is presented and data from the literature are reviewed, A 26-year-old pregnant woman was presented with abnormal genital bleeding, abdominal pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
